{"mt_tconst": "the-lord-of-the-rings-the-two-towers", "mt_user": "PQuinny", "mt_user_review_score": 9, "mt_user_review_date": "Jan 28, 2012", "mt_user_review": "The Two Towers is an extraordinary movie which only Peter Jackson can deliver. It's a sequel to the 2001 movie The Fellowship of the Ring, and it continues the adventures of Frodo Baggins as he carries on his quest to destroy the One Ring in the fiery depths of Mt. Doom to sabotage the Dark Lord Sauron once and for all. Peter Jackson once again proves his mastery of the Middle Earth universe in this movie.", "url": "https://www.metacritic.com/movie/the-lord-of-the-rings-the-two-towers/user-reviews", "spider": "mt_user_review", "date": "20/08/2021"}
